# The Dapr versions this track's image pins. Single owner (design §9.6).
#
# Read as build args by images/base/Dockerfile and by the CI workflow. Keep the two version
# lines as bare KEY=VALUE with no trailing comment: dapr-university-instruqt's
# tools/track-tester/ci/setup-dapr-secrets.sh parses them with `awk '{print $NF}'`.
#
# TEMPORARY TWIN: until the v2 lab replaces it, dapr-university-instruqt's
# dapr-secrets/_setup/sandbox-setup.sh carries these same two numbers. Change both together.
DAPR_CLI_VERSION=1.18.2
DAPR_RUNTIME_VERSION=1.18.7
